## 2. Fact (2): exhaustive split-order classification

Window: `1<δ<8/3` (Xu Prop 7.3, proof exhibited pp.10–11; ceiling of §1).
Integers: only `δ=2` lies in the window; `δ=1` is Prop 7.3 (no split);
